  "logline": "In a broke, half-burned Brooklyn at the end of the 1970s, a hard-used private eye is pulled into a case over a legendary \"bird\" that everyone swears will change their life -- a hunt that drags him through parish halls, union bars, mob basements, and City Hall back rooms.",
  "detail": "A Brooklyn-born riff on Hammett's classic: San Francisco noir transplanted to Carroll Gardens and Bensonhurst. The \"bird\" becomes local leverage in a quiet war between old-world gangsters, real-estate sharks, and a political machine trying to cash out. Conceived as a limited-series roadmap built from the same spine. The Falcon flies again, but the rules of the streets have changed entirely.",
